    },
    "message": "Write CounterRNG keys part by part instead of through json.dumps\n\nEach draw built its key with json.dumps(list(key_parts), ...), about\n770,000 times in a day of 100 people. Exact ints and exact strings that JSON\nwrites unescaped are now written directly; other parts still go through\njson.dumps, so the key bytes and every draw are unchanged. A test compares\ndraws with the documented JSON-keyed definition for every kind of part.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
